# KEEP THIS: CI stages the build-time env as .env.production before docker
# build. Removing this negation strips it from the build context, Vite bakes
# empty VITE_ vars, and the deployed UI can't reach the API ("Failed to get
# authentication nonce"). Already broke prod once.
!.env.production
